{"text": "At the corner stood a drugstore that was bright with electric lights. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When they came into the glare, each man turned to look at the others face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are not Jimmy Wells, said the man from the West, stopping suddenly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twenty years is a long time, but it is not long enough to change a mans nose from a Roman to a pug. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It sometimes changes a good man into a bad one, said the tall man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have been under arrest for ten minutes, Silky Bob, The police in Chicago want to talk with you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are going quietly, are you, That is sensible. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before we go to the station, here is a note that I was asked to give you, It is from Patrolman Wells. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bob opened the little note, His hand was steady at first, but it trembled a little by the end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bob, I was at the appointed place on time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When you struck the match to light your cigar, I saw the face of the man who was wanted in Chicago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Somehow I could not do it myself, so I went and got a plain clothes man to do the job, Jimmy.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "r", "n", "e", "r", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "a", " ", "d", "r", "u", "g", "s", "t", "o", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "r", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "e", "l", "e", "c", "t", "r", "i", "c", " ", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "l", "a", "r", "e", ",", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "o", "o", 